==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
Since this stage isn't very difficult, there shouldn't be much trouble beating this stage. If you have trouble since you're early in the game, stall the first peons for money and use ranged attackers with a couple of meatshields. [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Rocker Cat]] is very useful here.

